sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Mesh as Service Mesh<br/>(Istio/OSSM)<br/>TLS Termination + mTLS
    participant HTTP as Uvicorn Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as TGIS Adapter<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant Engine as vLLM Engine<br/>GPU PagedAttention
    participant GPU as GPU Device<br/>CUDA

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,Mesh: OpenAI-Compatible REST Flow
        Client->>Mesh: POST /v1/completions<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.3
        Mesh->>HTTP: Forward request<br/>HTTP/8000, mTLS
        HTTP->>Engine: Parse & queue inference request
        Engine->>GPU: Execute model inference<br/>PagedAttention scheduling
        GPU-->>Engine: Inference result tensors
        Engine-->>HTTP: Generated tokens
        HTTP-->>Mesh: JSON response
        Mesh-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,Mesh: TGIS gRPC Flow
        Client->>Mesh: gRPC GenerationService<br/>HTTPS/443, TLS 1.3
        Mesh->>GRPC: Forward request<br/>gRPC/8033, mTLS
        GRPC->>Engine: Translate TGIS → vLLM request
        Engine->>GPU: Execute model inference<br/>PagedAttention scheduling
        GPU-->>Engine: Inference result tensors
        Engine-->>GRPC: Generated tokens
        GRPC-->>Mesh: gRPC response
        Mesh-->>Client: HTTPS response
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over Engine,GPU: Model Loading (startup)
        Note right of Engine: Model loaded at container<br/>startup from configured<br/>storage (S3, PVC, etc.)
        Engine->>GPU: Load model weights to GPU memory
        GPU-->>Engine: Model ready
    end
